    "name": "Celbugs",
    "steam_appid": 2571330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571330/extras/2f235bfa270883a730e2dcccc6644b39.avif?t=1703635027\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>Welcome to Celbug Island!</strong><br><br>You've just awoken on an island home to colourful, cubic critters known as Celbugs. The Celbugs are in grave danger: square-shaped Gnats, born from human pollution, are preying on them. It's down to you to amass an army of Celbugs and help return their species to its former glory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>- Breed Celbugs together, creating offspring that inherits from both parents<br>- Take your Celbugs into 25 different Bug Battles, and destroy Gnats with unique abilities<br>- Appease the Celbug God to upgrade your in-battle hand, and unlock more Bug Battles",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571330/extras/2f235bfa270883a730e2dcccc6644b39.avif?t=1703635027\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>Welcome to Celbug Island!</strong><br><br>You've just awoken on an island home to colourful, cubic critters known as Celbugs. The Celbugs are in grave danger: square-shaped Gnats, born from human pollution, are preying on them. It's down to you to amass an army of Celbugs and help return their species to its former glory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>- Breed Celbugs together, creating offspring that inherits from both parents<br>- Take your Celbugs into 25 different Bug Battles, and destroy Gnats with unique abilities<br>- Appease the Celbug God to upgrade your in-battle hand, and unlock more Bug Battles",
    "short_description": "A colour-matching puzzle game in which you breed cute critters - Celbugs - and use them to beat levels.",
